{"speciesId":47,"names":{"fr":"Parasect","es":"Parasect","en":"Parasect","ja":"パラセクト"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"A host-parasite pair in which the parasite mushroom has taken over the host bug. Prefers damp places."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"A host-parasite pair in which the parasite mushroom has taken over the host bug. Prefers damp places."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"The bug host is drained of energy by the mushrooms on its back. They appear to do all the thinking."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It stays mostly in dark, damp places, the preference not of the bug, but of the big mush­ rooms on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"The larger the mushroom on its back grows, the stronger the mush­ room spores it scatters."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"When nothing's left to extract from the bug, the mushrooms on its back leave spores on the bug's egg."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"PARASECT is known to infest large trees en masse and drain nutrients from the lower trunk and roots. When an infested tree dies, they move onto another tree all at once."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"PARASECT is known to infest large trees en masse and drain nutrients from the lower trunk and roots. When an infested tree dies, they move onto another tree all at once."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"PARASECT are known to infest the roots of large trees en masse and drain nutrients. When an infested tree dies, they move onto another tree all at once."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It scatters toxic spores from the mushroom cap. In China, the spores are used as herbal medicine."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A host-parasite pair in which the parasite mushroom has taken over the host bug. Prefers damp places."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls PARASECT. It scatters poisonous spores."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is controlled by a mushroom grown larger than the bug body. It is said to prefer damp places."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls PARASECT. It scatters poisonous spores."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It stays mostly in dark, damp places, the preference not of the bug, but of the big mushroom on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The larger the mushroom on its back grows, the stronger the mushroom spores it scatters."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un champignon parasite plus gros que Parasect contrôle son corps. Il répand des spores empoisonnées."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls Parasect. It scatters poisonous spores."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un champignon parasite plus gros que Parasect contrôle son corps. Il répand des spores empoisonnées."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls Parasect. It scatters poisonous spores."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls Parasect. It scatters poisonous spores."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls Parasect. It scatters poisonous spores."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un champignon parasite plus gros que Parasect contrôle son corps. Il répand des spores empoisonnées."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Parasect está dominado por una seta parásita mayor que él. Dispersa esporas venenosas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls Parasect. It scatters poisonous spores."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体よりも 大きな キノコが パラセクトを 操っている。 毒の 胞子を ばらまく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Plus le champignon sur son dos grandit, plus celui-ci émet des spores puissantes dans l’air."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuanto más grande sea la seta de su lomo, más resistentes serán las esporas que esta suelta."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The larger the mushroom on its back grows, the stronger the mushroom spores it scatters."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"背中の キノコが 育つほど ばらまかれる キノコの 胞子の 効果は 強力になる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On sait que les Parasect vivent en groupe dans les grands arbres et se nourrissent des nutriments contenus dans le tronc et les racines. Lorsqu’un arbre infesté meurt, ils se précipitent vers le prochain."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Parasect es conocido por destruir en plaga grandes árboles, absorbiendo los nutrientes que tienen en la parte baja del tronco y las raíces. Cuando un árbol azotado por la plaga muere, los Parasect van a por el siguiente al instante."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Parasect is known to infest large trees en masse and drain nutrients from the lower trunk and roots. When an infested tree dies, they move onto another tree all at once."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"パラセクトは 集団で 大木の 根元に くっついて 栄養を 吸い取ってしまう。 枯れると 一斉に 別の 木に 移動する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On sait que les Parasect vivent en groupe dans les grands arbres et se nourrissent des nutriments contenus dans le tronc et les racines. Lorsqu’un arbre infesté meurt, ils se précipitent vers le prochain."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Parasect es conocido por destruir en plaga grandes árboles, absorbiendo los nutrientes que tienen en la parte baja del tronco y las raíces. Cuando un árbol azotado por la plaga muere, los Parasect van a por el siguiente al instante."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Parasect is known to infest large trees en masse and drain nutrients from the lower trunk and roots. When an infested tree dies, they move onto another tree all at once."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"パラセクトは 集団で 大木の 根元に くっついて 栄養を 吸い取ってしまう。 枯れると 一斉に 別の 木に 移動する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Le gros champignon sur son dos contrôle le Pokémon. Lampignon et Parasect se disputent souvent un même territoire."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"La gran seta en su lomo lo controla. A menudo libra luchas territoriales contra Shiinotic."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The large mushroom on its back controls it. It often fights over territory with Shiinotic."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"大きな キノコが パラセクトを 操っている。 よく マシェードと 縄張り争いを している。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il répand des spores empoisonnées depuis son chapeau. On peut les récolter et les faire sécher pour préparer des remèdes traditionnels."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"La gran seta en su lomo dispersa esporas venenosas, que pueden servir para elaborar remedios medicinales."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It scatters toxic spores from its mushroom cap. Once harvested, these spores can be steeped and boiled down to prepare herbal medicines."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"キノコの カサから 毒の胞子を 撒き散らす。 胞子を 集めて 煎じると 漢方薬に なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"L’insecte est quasiment mort, à ce stade, et le champignon est devenu le véritable cerveau. Si on l’ôte de son dos, il ne peut plus bouger."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La mayor parte de su cuerpo está atrofiada, excepto la seta del dorso, que controla al resto. Si se desprende, Parasect ya no podrá moverse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The bug is mostly dead, with the mushroom on its back having become the main body. If the mushroom comes off, the bug stops moving."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ムシの 方は ほぼ 死んでいて 本体は 背中の キノコだ。 もげると もう 動かなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Des remèdes traditionnels sont préparés avec ses spores empoisonnées, mais ceux produits à Alola seraient de moindre qualité."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sus esporas venenosas se usan para elaborar remedios medicinales que en Alola, al parecer, son de calidad más bien mediocre."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its poisonous spores are also used in traditional medicine. Apparently, spores produced in Alola are not of very good quality."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"毒の 胞子は 漢方薬にも 使われる。 アローラ産は あまり 質が 良くないらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"À force de voir son énergie aspirée, il semblerait que ce ne soit plus l’insecte qui réfléchisse, mais le champignon sur son dos."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Tras largo tiempo absorbiendo la energía del huésped, la seta parásita del lomo es la que parece controlar la voluntad de este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"The bug host is drained of energy by the mushroom on its back. The mushroom appears to do all the thinking."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"ずっと エキスを 吸い続けられ もはや ムシではなく 背中の キノコが 考えているようだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"À force de voir son énergie aspirée, il semblerait que ce ne soit plus l’insecte qui réfléchisse, mais le champignon sur son dos."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Tras largo tiempo absorbiendo la energía del huésped, la seta parásita del lomo es la que parece controlar la voluntad de este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"The bug host is drained of energy by the mushroom on its back. The mushroom appears to do all the thinking."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"ずっと エキスを 吸い続けられ もはや ムシではなく 背中の キノコが 考えているようだ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Mushroom-lacking specimens of this Pokémon lie unmoving in the forest, lending credence t